    <string name="about_features_label">Features</string>
    <string name="about_features_text">· Todos: add, check off, edit (✏️), delete (swipe to confirm), undo\n· Categories: None / Work / Study / Life, color-coded\n· Pin: long-press a todo to pin it — important things stay on top\n· Due reminders: set a due time and get a system notification (exact alarm, auto-rescheduled after reboot)\n· Repeating todos: daily / weekly / monthly auto-reschedule\n· Timeline: todos strung along a vertical line by due date\n· Completion stats: ring + per-category progress at a glance\n· Home widget: check off todos right from the desktop, one-tap create\n· Search &amp; filter: find by keyword or category\n· Backup &amp; restore: export / import JSON backups, batch-import multi-line text\n· In-app update: one tap to upgrade when a new version is found</string>
    <string name="about_usage_label">How to Use</string>
    <string name="about_usage_text">1. Add a todo: tap the round \"+\" button at bottom right; or use the widget\'s \"+\" to jot one down\n2. Complete: tap the checkbox on the left; repeating todos auto-reschedule to the next cycle\n3. Edit / delete: tap \"✏️\" to edit; swipe left to reveal the delete button, then confirm\n4. Category / due date: pick a category color and set a due date in the add or edit dialog (reminders fire automatically)\n5. Switch views: the \"List / Timeline / Stats\" tabs at the top\n6. Add a home widget: \"+ Widget\" in the app bar; or long-press home screen → Widgets → Little Brain\n7. Back up data: \"Export Backup\" in the menu saves JSON; \"Import Backup\" restores</string>
    <string name="about_privacy">Fully offline · data stays on your phone · no network, no upload</string>
